{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝应许拯救祂的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对耶利米说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“以色列的上帝耶和华这样说，‘你要把我对你说的一切话写在书卷上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华说：看啊，时候将到，我要使我被掳的以色列和犹大子民返乡，回到我赐给他们祖先的土地上，恢复他们的地业。这是耶和华说的。’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"以下是耶和华谈论以色列和犹大的话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我听见惊恐战栗的喊叫声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们去问问看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"男人能分娩吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么我看见男人们都双手捂着肚子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像分娩的妇人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脸色苍白呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唉！无比可怕的日子快来了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那将是雅各子孙的苦难之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他们必得拯救。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["万军之耶和华说：“那日，我要折断他们颈上的轭，砍断他们的锁链，使他们不再受外族人奴役。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他们要事奉他们的上帝耶和华，服侍我为他们选立来坐大卫宝座的王。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"“我的仆人雅各啊，不要害怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，不要惊慌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我必从远方拯救你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从流亡之地拯救你的后裔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使雅各重归故土，安享太平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不受惊吓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我与你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要拯救你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要彻底毁灭列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我曾使你流亡的地方。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我不会彻底毁灭你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不会放过你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必公正地惩治你。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们的创伤无法医治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的伤口无法痊愈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有人为你们辩护，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的伤处无药可治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们无法痊愈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的盟友都忘了你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对你们漠不关心。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像你们的仇敌一样击打你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像敌人一样残酷地惩罚你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们罪大恶极，罪过无数。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们缘何为自己的创伤哭泣？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的创伤无法医治。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们罪大恶极，罪过无数，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我才这样惩罚你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，吞吃你们的必被吞吃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的敌人全被掳走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掳掠你们的必被掳掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抢夺你们的必被抢夺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们被称为弃儿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是无人关心的锡安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要医治你们的创伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们康复。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，我要使雅各家被掳的子孙返乡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要怜悯他们的家园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们在废墟上重建城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在原处重修宫殿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那里必传出感谢和欢乐的声音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他们人丁兴旺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再减少；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他们得享尊荣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再受歧视。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的儿女要如往日一样兴旺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他们的会众坚立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要惩罚所有压迫他们的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的首领将是自己的同胞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的元首将出自本族。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必带领他近前来，他必到我面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为无人敢贸然来到我面前。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要做我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要做你们的上帝。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和华的怒气必如风暴一样横扫过来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刮到恶人头上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华不完成祂心中的计划，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的烈怒必不止息。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将来有一天，你们会明白。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}